{
    "name": "E2E Upsales - Updated Ticket trigger",
    "description": "Polling trigger TicketUpdated reports a ticket created by the flow.",
    "notes": {
        "a002fa38-3069-45b1-aa37-0f99be060a5b": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 900,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 220,
            "content": "## Polling trigger\n\nThe trigger polls every minute and its first tick only records where it starts. The flow waits 2 minutes, then creates the ticket the trigger must report on a later tick; a Condition keeps only the ticket of this run. AfterAll timeout is 420 s. Do not remove the Wait.\n\nThe account needs the **Customer Support** product and at least one ticket status and type."
        }
    },
